libgsystem
------------------------------------------
LibGSystem is a GIO-based library, targeted primarily for use by operating
system components.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  girepository-GLib2.0-1.86.0-2
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libgsystem-devel-2015.2-1bl1
  libgsystem0-2015.2-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gnome-common-3.18.0-1
  gobject-introspection-1.86.0-2
  gtk-doc-1.37.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://wiki.gnome.org/Projects/LibGSystem

Canonical download:
  git://git.gnome.org/libgsystem

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libgsystem-2015.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libgsystem-2015.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libgsystem-2015.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgsystem-2015.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgsystem0-2015.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgsystem-devel-2015.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/girepository-GSystem1.0-2015.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libgsystem)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libgsystem.README
  /usr/share/doc/libgsystem/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libgsystem/README

(libgsystem0)
  /usr/bin/cyggsystem-0.dll

(libgsystem-devel)
  /usr/include/libgsystem/gsystem-console.h
  /usr/include/libgsystem/gsystem-errors.h
  /usr/include/libgsystem/gsystem-file-utils.h
  /usr/include/libgsystem/gsystem-glib-compat.h
  /usr/include/libgsystem/gsystem-local-alloc.h
  /usr/include/libgsystem/gsystem-log.h
  /usr/include/libgsystem/gsystem-shutil.h
  /usr/include/libgsystem/gsystem-subprocess-context.h
  /usr/include/libgsystem/gsystem-subprocess.h
  /usr/include/libgsystem/libgsystem.h
  /usr/lib/libgsystem.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libgsystem.pc

(girepository-GSystem1.0)
  /usr/lib/girepository-1.0/GSystem-1.0.typelib
  /usr/share/gir-1.0/GSystem-1.0.gir

